window.products.push({"id":1083020,"name":"Love This Kitchen Premium Soft Coolers for Grocery Shopping, The Beach, Picnics and more","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cCXQKKowL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"Imported Nylon lining Zipper closure Machine Wash ✅ EXEMPLARY INSULATION: This insulated grocery bag is built with 4 layers of thick insulation for exceptional heat and cold retention that lasts up to 4 hours, which provides great storage for your fresh or frozen groceries while doing errands. It is equipped with dual handles and a sturdy zipper top that is easily sealable. This cooler bag will keep your food and drinks hot or cold during market trips, beach outings or picnics. ✅ COLLAPSIBLE, FOLDABLE AND WASHABLE: This cooler box folds flat when folded and only measures 12\"x9\"x2\". Simply fold it for a hassle-free and space-saving solution for shoppers. Ideal insulated bags for food transport and surely a must-have in every household. Plus 100% washable too - just toss them into the washing machine and voila! It's already clean and ready to use again! ✅ HEAVY-DUTY YET COMFORTABLE - Our insulated cooler bag is made of high-quality materials, the zippered top and sturdy dual handles make this a perfect solution for food delivery or transporting groceries - hot or cold. The padded handles is made for an easy and comfortable lifting; not found in other cheap, grocery bag, which allows you to carry the weight without hurting your hand or shoulder (no more fabric that cuts into your finger joints or shoulders). ✅ LARGE STORAGE CAPACITY: This insulated tote bag has a large dimension 12\"x12\"x9\", ideal for large or multiple small items such as food containers, wine bottles, frozen items and more! It easily fits on flat surfaces, shopping carts, or car trunks. So no worries that your groceries will scatter during travel or on your way home. ✅ 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEED – At Love This Kitchen, we use only the best materials to create top of the insulated shopping bags for groceries that are made to last. Established in USA since 2002, here is our promise: If you aren't 100% thrilled with your purchase, just contact Amazon within 30 days for a full refund. Plus, all our products have a 1 year Guarantee, so Order Now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cCXQKKowL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Love This Kitchen","source_asin":"B07YBLW1V2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1083020","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YBLW1V2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YBLW1V2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
