window.products.push({"id":1083092,"name":"Daverose Calming Weighted Blanket for Adults 20lbs 58¡±X80¡± 180-220lbs Adults Queen Size | Plush Minky One Piece Design | Children Comfort Sensory He","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CCdp+NZcL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Minky Imported 1.PROFESSIONAL FACTORY FOR 15 YEARS - Daverose is a professional weighted blanket design and production factory, and now we officially launch this innovative one-piece design minky dot weighted blanket. Here is a great chance for you to abandon the traditional one and pick a fashionable and elegant one for yourself or gifts, not to mention the money saved for a cover. Kids/adults love the touch of the rugged minky dot! Both sides can be close to your skin according to your like. 2.NEW GENERATION INTEGRATION - Daverose cares what you care, so all weighted blankets are made of eco-friendly glass beads and breathable minky fabrics. We adapt unique 7-layer quilting system, which adds two layers more than others, weakening graininess and locking warmth. Every blanket passed the OEKO-TEX STANDARD 100 CERTIFICATE(Textile authority certification), 100% safe for kids use. 3.PIONEERING SLEEP TECHNOLOGY - What we bring you is not only a blanket, but a big hug! Humans tend to feel security when swaddled, so having our weighted blanket wrapped around your body eases and relaxes the mind. Around 10% of your body weight is recommended for the weight of the blanket. 58¡±x80¡± 20lbs is suitable for individuals weighing about 180-220lbs and QUEEN BED. 4.BEST AFTER-SALE 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE - No worries about the cleaning, use machine wash on a gentle cycle for no more than twice one year, to extend its service life, spot clean is more labor-saving. We offer a best after-sale service with 5-YEAR FREE WARRANTY (shipping label not included). Kindly email us for anything you think about our weighted blanket. 5.WE DO CARE YOU - We love you as our family, we want you to use the blanket safely by not covering your face or head. Pregnant women is not recommended. Welcome for any suggestions about our weighted blanket. We want to make your nights better and make our blankets better, so the world will be better. It is a dream and we will reach it with you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CCdp+NZcL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Daverose","source_asin":"B07PZ7SNTW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1083092","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PZ7SNTW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PZ7SNTW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
