window.products.push({"id":1083100,"name":"SupaCute Desserts Push up Pop Containers Twist in Stick and Base Set of 24, Mini Square","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Vtdxnbz-L._AC_SL1121_.jpg","description":"SupaCute Desserts ()The original \"Mini-me” square push up pop containers twist in stick and base BPA free capacity 2.16 ounce. Dishwasher safe, washable, reusable, freezable, disposable and recyclable. Design Patent. Manufactured by Laguna Wholesale.  The product detail make the difference! Twist in instead of pushing in, made just for you!  Back in February 2014, Laguna Wholesale created for you the new twist in style stick and base.  It 's beneficial for big companies to mass produce desserts using these unique and freezer safe push pop containers with its shape, design, style, quality in addition to a top flat 1 inch tall lid.  This improved twist in style stick and base is great for mass productions, filling, storing and shipping.   To store your cake push pops, simply untwist the stick for EASY storage.   To ship your cake push pops, simply untwist the stick for EASY and SAFE shipping.   To mass produce dessert push pops, simply untwist the stick for EASY filling.   To serve simply twist the stick into the base instead of pushing in and voilà, it's done! It was perfect before and now it's much better!Set of 24 piece unique push up pops ideal for confetti poppers and cake push up pops. The original Square Mini-Me push up pop containers with lids are also perfect party ideas to add depth at the table of any occasions, catering events, party favors, birthday party, baby showers and much more.   Extraordinary popsicle molds freezer safe push pop containers with its shape, design, style, quality in addition to a top flat 1 inch tall lid.   It is made of beautiful high quality durable food grade plastic. It is an exclusive push pop cake containers from Laguna Wholesale. These fashionable and impressive push up pop containers are perfect to enlighten any celebration. IT'S REALLY COOL TO BE SQUARE! For quality and reliability there's only #1 Laguna Wholesale","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Vtdxnbz-L._AC_SL1121_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SupaCute Desserts","source_asin":"B00PE3QE80","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1083100","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00PE3QE80","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00PE3QE80","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
