window.products.push({"id":1083158,"name":"Lilymeche Concept - Silicone Macaron Baking Mats - BPA Free Large Nonstick Kitchen Professional Reusable Heat Resistant Baking 2 Half Sheets Bakeware ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710uIk0gtCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BAKE LIKE A PRO - Get the perfect Macarons every time with our non-stick silicone macaron baking mats. These baking mats are safe, BPA-free, and non-toxic. In addition to macarons, our silicone baking mats can be used for a wide range of other baking projects, such as cookies, pastries, and even savory dishes like roasted vegetables. SAVE TIME AND MESS - Say goodbye to disposable parchment papers. Use our silicone baking mat as macarons baking mat, cookie sheet liners or pastry mats since they are very easy to clean and use, no more scraping. Just put it in the dishwasher or wash it with soap and you're all done! HEAT-RESISTANT - Our high-quality silicone pastry mat, rolling mat, and dough mats are designed to last for years. Its flexible and versatile yet tear resistant, your baking options are limitless, it is heat resistant up to -40~250°C(-40~482F). These mats are suitable for use in the oven, microwave, and freezer. EVERY BAKER NEEDS ONE - Our food grade macaron baking mat eliminates the use of any type of butter, oil, grease and cooking making. It is a healthier alternative than wasteful parchment paper. Whether you're an experienced baker or a beginner, this high-quality bread baking supplies are essential for creating delicious macarons. From dough enhancers to non-stick silicone baking mats, invest in the tools that will take your macaron making to the next level. PERFECT SIZE - Measuring at 16.9*12.2*0.08 inches, our half sheet silicone mat is the perfect size for all your baking needs. In addition to being the perfect size for all your baking needs, our half sheet silicone mat is specifically designed for macaron baking. The macaron silicone mat provides consistent and even heat distribution, resulting in perfectly shaped and delicious macarons every time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710uIk0gtCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lilymeche Concept","source_asin":"B0BX6M6515","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1083158","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BX6M6515","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BX6M6515","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
