window.products.push({"id":1083539,"name":"WINIAER Ceramic Sake Set with Warmer Pot, Traditional Pottery Hot Cold Saki Drink Set, 8 Pieces Include 1 Stove, 1 Warming Bowl, 1 Sake Pot, 4 Sake Cu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hXqx7lgML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Great sake set made of thermal shock resistant ceramic, stovetop safe, extreme hot and cold tolerance. Focus on warm sake drinks. Equipped with a ceramic stove, because the heater keeps your wine bottle warm to extend your enjoyment. A creative curved lip sake cup designed for easy drinking. It is very suitable for entertaining and entertaining guests at home or in a restaurant. The sake set is full of oriental cultural flavor, suitable for Asian culture lovers, can be used for tea parties, and can also be used as home decoration. This sake gift set is elegant in nature and comes with a gift package. A great gift for Father's Day, Birthday, Anniversary, wedding, Christmas and Sake of the Month. This ceramic sake set is equipped with 1 sake bottle, 1 Warming Bowl, 4 sake cups, and 1 stove for keeping warm (not including candles). All are packaged with a protective gift box for easy and portable carrying. Also great gift choice for sake lovers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hXqx7lgML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WINIAER","source_asin":"B0993BB1Z1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1083539","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0993BB1Z1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0993BB1Z1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1083540,"name":"Empire Art Direct Magenta Cosmo on White Frameless Free Floating Tempered Glass Panel Graphic Flower Wall Art Ready to Hang 40\" x 40\" x 0.2\" Magenta C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":128.87,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81z5ZJsnJpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"About EAD Empire Art Direct has a long rich history of manufacturing wall art and home furnishings since 1948. At EAD, we are proud to be creating the best decorative products on the market. Our decorative are over 1, 000 designs, EAD has a variety of wall decorative for all moments in your life. Features Item Name: Empire Art Direct Magenta Cosmo on White Frameless Free Floating Tempered Glass Panel Graphic Wall Art, 40\" x 40\" x 0.2\", Ready to HangModel Name: Magenta Cosmo on WhiteColor: PinkStyle: Contemporary Material: Tempered Glass Technics: Digital super high resolution HD printing is manufactured on the reverse side of the ultra white glass. Featuring Crystals ultra white tempered glass that is designed to enhance depth and colors unlike conventional commercial glass. This frameless, free-floating, reverse printed, tempered art glass decor can be hung on any wall horizontally. Actual prints colors may be slightly different from pictures shown online due to different monitors. Packing: Packing with Styrofoam in every side and protective corners in carton Product Size & Weight: 40 in. x 40 in. x 0.2 in. & 27.3 lbs. Package Size & Weight: 42.9 in. x 42.7 in. x 2 in. & 29.3 lbs. Decoration This elusive flower resembles a pink hibiscus. The artist is able to achieve an effect of delicacy and frailty in the petals with an overall mood of calm and beauty. Painting the flower on one side and then viewing it from the other brings out stunning definition and clarity. Paintings in the Vetro De Arte series will blend in nicely with your indoor garden room as well as adding brightness and color to your modern art collection.About returns policy and our services If you are not satisfied with our product or order wrong item, please let us know immediately, we will offer you the best services. Check out Empire Art Direct for more choices! ORDER NOW! DON'T MISS OUT, LIMITED STOCK!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81z5ZJsnJpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Empire Art Direct","source_asin":"B00Y2KCLGU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1083540","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00Y2KCLGU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00Y2KCLGU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1083541,"name":"Tie Dye Party Supplies for Birthday Tableware Set includes 16 7\" Plates 16 6.5\" Napkins 16 9 oz Cups and a 70.8\" x 42.5\" Tablecloth for Hippie Rainbow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fo975GZAL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Looking for the perfect party supplies to make your next event a colorful and cheerful celebration? Look no further than the Tie Dye Party Supplies from Smart Sale Well!  This party set is a must-have for anyone who loves vibrant and fun designs. It includes everything you need to throw a fantastic tie dye-themed party, including 16 7\" plates, 16 9 oz. cups, 16 6.5\" soft and absorbent napkins and a 70.8\"x42.5\" tablecloth. And with a colorful tie dye print pattern featuring shades of pink, red, bright orange, yellow, green, aqua, blue, purple, and white, your guests are sure to be impressed.  One of the best things about our Tie Dye Party Supplies is its high quality construction. The plates are made from premium quality thick paper, ensuring they can handle even the heartiest of meals. The napkins are soft and absorbent, making them ideal for wiping up spills and messes. And with a 9 oz. capacity, the cups are perfect for serving up cold drinks to keep your guests refreshed and hydrated throughout the party.  Another great feature of this party set is its versatility. Whether you're planning a birthday party, baby shower, summer event, pool party, kid's party, dessert buffet, picnic, or any special occasion, our Tie Dye Party Set is sure to be a hit. And with enough plates, cups, and napkins to serve up to 16 guests, you'll have plenty of supplies to go around.  But perhaps one of the best things about this party set is its convenience. Because all the items are disposable, you can spend less time worrying about cleaning up and more time enjoying the company of your loved ones. After the party is over, simply collect the tablecloth with all the garbage and throw them away. It's that easy!  So why settle for boring and plain party supplies when you can add some color and fun to your event with our Tie Dye Party Supplies? Order now and get ready to impress your guests with a fantastic and memorable celebration!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fo975GZAL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SmartSaleWell","source_asin":"B089JCPDBF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1083541","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089JCPDBF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089JCPDBF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
