window.products.push({"id":1083619,"name":"Ne'Qwa Art 7211104 Merry & Bright 1st Christmas Hand-Painted Blown Glass Ornament, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41XinXryrHL._AC_.jpg","description":"It’s the beginning of a magical childhood – a new baby experiencing Christmas for the first time is a wondrous thing to behold! Capture the year they first saw all the twinkling lights, heard the beautiful carols, and smelled the Christmas cookies baking. Honor it all with a sweet ornament offering plenty of vintage charm. A pram and polka dots in nostalgic hues welcome the little one to enjoy all the splendors of the holiday. Inspired by the artwork of Nancy Mink, Ne’Qwa Art artisans recreate her whimsical design on an ornament that will be treasured for a lifetime. This gift includes a Certificate of Authenticity and is beautifully packaged in a satin-lined, keepsake gift box. This stunning Baby’s First Christmas ornament is a thoughtful Christmas gift for new parents and grandparents of baby boys and girls. It also makes a unique baby shower gift! An adjustable tasseled cord allows for display on a Christmas tree or a Ne’Qwa Art ornament stand. This ornament measures approximately 3”H. Petite Princess shape. All genuine Ne’Qwa Art ornaments and gifts are created with the ancient technique of hand-painting original art on the inside of mouth-blown glass. With meticulous attention to every detail, trained artisans use specially designed paintbrushes to re-create stunning works of original art. Make memories to treasure for a lifetime with authentic Ne’Qwa Art glass ornaments and gifts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41XinXryrHL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ne'Qwa","source_asin":"B08X3VGBCB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1083619","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08X3VGBCB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08X3VGBCB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
