window.products.push({"id":1083890,"name":"Abestorm Commercial Dehumidifier with Pump Drain Hose, 180 Pints Large Capacity Industrial Dehumidifier for Basements, Garages, Job Sites, 5 Years War","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":873.04,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uWeUYYFJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👍【Commercial Dehumidifier, Lightweight Rotomolded Polyethylene Shell + Big Wheels + Handles, Easy Mobility, Durable Use】Large capacity commercial-grade dehumidifier remove moisture up to 180pint per day at saturation, 85pint per day at AHAM, up to 2,300sq.ft, perfect for basement, construction sites, warehouse, flood & water damage restoration, carpet cleaning, fast drying in indoor greenhouse, pool,ect. 👍【Industrial Dehumidifier Buitl-in Heavy-duty Pump,More Convenient, No Need to Empty the Tank, Continuous Drainage】Abestorm commercial dehumidifier with pump and 19.6ft drain hose, 14.7ft vertical drainage height, give you the freedom to drain anywhere. Built-in pump can continuously drain water, greatly improve the dehumidification efficiency, shorten the working time. 👍【Durable Commercial Dehumidifiers Built to Withstand More Rugged Conditions, Wide Range of Application】A commercial dehumidifier with waterproof and anti-corrosion shell, ideal for flood/water restoration, damp basements, and construction job sites. An automatic defrost system allows the dehumidifier can work in temperatures as low as 36°F. 👍【Portable Dehumidifier Commercial-grade, Auto Turns On/Shut Off, Effortless Humidity Control】With the built-in humidity sensor and digital control panel, you can set the desired humidity value. This industrial dehumidifier will auto cycle ON/OFF to maintain the desired humidity level(Under the condition of power on). Meanwhile, jobs hours display, auto drain, and auto restart after the power outage, professional and intelligent design, easy to use. 👍【5 Years Warranty】ETL listed dehumidifier. Every Abestorm dehumidifier comes with a 5-year warranty and a professional customer support team ready to assist at any time. Please feel free to contact us; you deserve the best after-sales service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uWeUYYFJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Abestorm","source_asin":"B09N933GJX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1083890","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09N933GJX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09N933GJX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
